the Counter is an actor.
this's Tries is a number.

this can Try.
this's Try does...
    when this has Tries?
        when this's Tries is 0?
            this's Tries is 1.
            this is failed with error "first attempt"!
        or?
            this's Tries is 2.
            this is ok with "second attempt"!
    or?
        this's Tries is 0.
        this is failed with error "no tries field"!

the App is a script.

Counter's Tries is 0.

do Counter's Try...
    when failed?
        log that's error.
        do that retry.
        when ok?
            log that.
        or?
            log "still failed".
    or?
        log that.
